Dollar Bill Scanner is a useful app made for banknote collectors, enthusiasts and numismatists of every level. Scan, identify and value 110,000+ varieties for 42,000+ banknote types from around the world. Build, keep and manage your personal banknote collection, also track its value in one  app easily. Search and find any banknote with easy-to-use search tool. Study 33+ educational banknote articles.

Dollar Bill Scanner app turns your device into a powerful, fast and accurate banknote scanning, identification, value and collecting tool! Just snap photos of both sides of the banknote and get the scan result in seconds with detailed info about your note. Improve your banknote collecting experience and expand your knowledge with this helpful app.
 
KEY FEATURES & APP CONTENT:

- Bill Scanner & Identifier - Scan and identify any banknote from all over the world. Snap photos of both sides of the banknote or upload them from your gallery to receive detailed info quickly, including the banknote's name, value, issuer, issue years, and much more.
- Banknote Value - Get the value of any banknote from all over the world. Receive estimated values and reference prices based on the banknote's grade.
- Full Banknote Info - Receive in-depth details about any scanned and identified banknote, such as the issuer, issue years, value, lettering and more. Also explore high-resolution images of both sides for accurate reference.
- Banknote Search Tool - Looking for something special? No problem! Search and find any banknote you are interested in and get detailed info about it with its market value as well.
- Personal Banknote Collection - Build, keep and manage your personal banknote collection easily. Organize your collection in one convenient place, track its value, and access it anytime, anywhere.
- Educational Banknote Articles - Explore the captivating world of banknotes with our educational resources. Study 33 articles on topics like the history of banknotes, banknotes grading, and tips for collectors of any level.

Disclaimer: Please note that we cant guaranty the 100% accurate banknote identification and value results. Unfortunately not every banknote has market value info.

Note that free version of the app is limited to:
– 1 Banknote Scanning;
– 3 Banknote Articles.
If you want to use the app without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”Unlimited Access” is available.
 
Auto-renewable Subscription ”Unlimited Access” Info:
By subscribing you get premium (full, unlimited) access to all the features and content offered by app.

Auto-renewable Subscription “Unlimited Access” Includes:
– Scan & Identify Banknotes Unlimited;
– Value Banknotes Unlimited;
– Create Unlimited Banknote Collection;
– Unlock Search For Any Banknote;
– Unlock All Banknote Articles;

The app contains the following auto-renewable subscription called ”Unlimited Access”:
– Weekly (3,99 US$) with a 3-days for free period.
* Subscription price may vary depending on your location;
* Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;
* Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;
* Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal;
* Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account;
* Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.

Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/banknote-scanner-privacy/
Terms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/banknote-scanner-terms/

Requested Access:
Photos – access which allows you to upload selected photos of banknotes to scan, identify and value them.
Camera – access which allows you to snap photos of banknotes to scan, identify and value them.

